               <msContents>
                  <msItem n="1" xml:id="MS_Gough_Norf_18-item1">
                     <title key="work_14257" type="desc">Register of the Cluniac priory of <orgName key="org_139999868">SS. Mary and Andrew, Thetford</orgName></title>
                    
                     <note>A miscellaneous register (c. 1360-1390, with additions), apparently imperfect, of charters, extents, accounts, and other memoranda, in several mostly contemporary hands. Fol. 48r is an index (by Peter le Leve (?): see Provenance).</note>
                     <textLang mainLang="la" otherLangs="xno enm">Latin with Anglo-Norman (fols. 45v, 47v) and Middle English (fols. 18r, 29r).</textLang>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
